+## Requirement: Teardown completion
+
+Flask SHALL attempt every registered request and application-context teardown
+callback, followed by every receiver of the corresponding teardown signal, even
+when earlier teardown actions raise. After cleanup, it SHALL raise all collected
+teardown errors as an exception group when supported by Python; otherwise it
+SHALL raise the first collected error. `AppContext.pop` SHALL restore
